-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §90 שבוע העבודה של סגן ראשון: a first
-- deputy's week is 40 hours; his frontal teaching by the school's
-- complexity — 21 to 18 in a primary school, 11, 11, 9, 9 in a junior high
-- school (a multi-stage special-education school's by his base on the
-- eve); the mother's and post-maternity reductions off the non-frontal
-- hours; and from 50, two weekly hours off them.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT womens_work_law
§ `90 שבוע העבודה של סגן ראשון`

@ref akn:art_90__para_a
`a first deputy's weekly hours` MEANS 40

@ref akn:art_90__para_b akn:art_90__para_b/p2 akn:art_90__para_b/t1 akn:art_90__para_b/p3 akn:art_90__para_b/t2
GIVEN stage IS A `school stage`, level IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's frontal hours` stage level IS
    IF stage EQUALS `a primary school`
    THEN 22 MINUS level
    ELSE IF level AT MOST 2 THEN 11 ELSE 9

-- (ג)–(ד): the reductions of §§24–25 and, from 50, two hours, all off the
-- non-frontal hours, the position and pay unchanged.
@ref akn:art_90__para_c akn:art_90__para_d
GIVEN `frontal hours` IS A NUMBER, `reduction under §§24–25` IS A NUMBER, age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a first deputy's non-frontal hours` `frontal hours` `reduction under §§24–25` age IS
    `a first deputy's weekly hours`
        MINUS `frontal hours`
        MINUS `reduction under §§24–25`
        MINUS (IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN 2 ELSE 0)

`the primary table of §90` MEANS LIST 21, 20, 19, 18
`the junior-high table of §90` MEANS LIST 11, 11, 9, 9

#ASSERT map (GIVEN l YIELD `a first deputy's frontal hours` `a primary school` l) (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4) EQUALS `the primary table of §90`
#ASSERT map (GIVEN l YIELD `a first deputy's frontal hours` `a junior high school` l) (LIST 1, 2, 3, 4) EQUALS `the junior-high table of §90`
#ASSERT `a first deputy's non-frontal hours` 19 0 51 EQUALS 19

-- The Women's Work Law (imported): (ג) gives a first deputy §25's hour a day
-- for four months after the leave, five stay hours a week of a 40-hour
-- week, off the hours that are not frontal teaching, at the same position
-- and pay — the law's parent's hour, not taken from pay (§7(ג)(3)), as
-- §25 itself gives it. The floor is met.
`§90(ג) gives a first deputy the parent's hour, as the Women's Work Law does` MEANS
        `a first deputy's non-frontal hours` 19 5 40 EQUALS 16
    AND 5 TIMES 60 EQUALS 5 TIMES `minutes a day of the parent's hour under the Women's Work Law` 0 TRUE
    AND NOT `the parent's hour is deducted from pay`
#ASSERT `§90(ג) gives a first deputy the parent's hour, as the Women's Work Law does`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Opportunities Law`: (ג) gives a first
-- deputy §24's shorter week for a mother teacher as §7(ג) defines her, and
-- the fathers that definition leaves out of §4(א) are weighed on §7(ג), on
-- the card mother-position-fathers (F-ofek-hadash-base-7-c).
